OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FA car thief rams the cops off the
OL,7,     Froad, a gang travel into North
OL,8,     FYorkshire for some high-end
OL,9,     Fshoplifting, and a suspected scrap
OL,10,     Fmetal thief claims he's running a
OL,11,     Flegitimate business.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThe police dog unit is called into
OL,14,     Faction to chase a thief. The
OL,15,     Fpursuit of a Range Rover leads to
OL,16,     Fa haul of stolen cars.
OL,17,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FDocumentary profiling a high-speed
OL,19,     Fpolice unit. This edition features
OL,20,     Fsome of the best moments of the
OL,21,     Fseries so far, including the
OL,22,     Fpursuit of a drug dealer.
