OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FIt's a Langham/Morgan double date.
OL,7,     FDylan gets the full story. Lacey
OL,8,     Fleans on her sister.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FDr Amir Khan suspects that Jake's
OL,11,     Fbloody cough could be TB. Varna's
OL,12,     Fbloodshot eye could be acute
OL,13,     Fglaucoma. Luke already has four
OL,14,     Fchildren so he is in for a
OL,15,     Fvasectomy.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FWith the computer system down, the
OL,18,     Fstaff resort to a whiteboard to
OL,19,     Fkeep track of everyone. Patients
OL,20,     Finclude two elderly men with
OL,21,     Fbreathing difficulties.
